  "description": "The Eve 8 is an elegant city bike built around a lightweight alluminium frame. One of the key features of the Eve 8 is the Gates belt drive, which is a cleaner alternative to a traditional chain. The Eve 8 is equipped with an 8-speed Shimano Nexus, hydraulic disc brakes that offer faultless stopping in all conditions, Impac tyres and a retro Alluminium Creme crankset. Featuring a comfortable Creme saddle with springs, Creme grips with aluminium bar ends and an aluminium basket and mount. An adjustable ahead stem for better riding comfort. Safety at night thanks to dynamo LED lights. Finished with an exceptionally beautiful multi layer gloss paint with a powder coat in Burgundy.",
